## Search notes (why self-excluded)

- BenchLM has no profile: `benchlm.ai/models/qoduck` returns HTTP 404.
- models.dev has no entry for `qoduck`.
- No vendor model card, system card or spec sheet exists — Qoder's own announcement explicitly states the origin is undisclosed.
- Secondary coverage (aitoolranked, startupfortune, orcarouter) carries no reproducible benchmark numbers, only hands-on impressions and a contested parameter-count leak.
- Resolution: this is a stealth preview. Per the repo's revealed-stealth rule it should be **merged into the revealed model** if and when Qoder names it — never scaffolded as a permanent model folder. Re-run this folder only after the reveal.

